<h2>Skipped / Pending Tests</h2>
<br>
<p>These tests did not fail. They are intentionally skipped because the matching frontend feature does not currently exist as a standalone testable flow.</p>
<br>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Skipped Test</th><th>Why It Is Skipped</th><th>How To Fix</th></tr>
<tr><td>S1</td><td>Facts/Myths standalone game page</td><td>Bloom has myth/fact behavior embedded in dashboard/FAB, but no standalone game page or route.</td><td>Add a standalone page or exported game component; add stable selectors for question, Fact/Myth buttons, feedback, score, next, and restart; wire it into navigation if needed; change `it.skip` to `it`.</td></tr>
<tr><td>S2</td><td>Unknown client route state</td><td>Bloom uses static pages and `404.html`; there is no client-side router fallback.</td><td>Decide whether unknown routes should use a client router or only `404.html`; add fallback selectors/message; enable the skipped test or replace it with a direct `404.html` test.</td></tr>
<tr><td>S3</td><td>Mood field saves in health log</td><td>Calendar logging currently has flow, symptoms, notes, and biometrics, but no first-class mood field.</td><td>Add a mood input to `calendar.html`; persist mood in `calendar.js`/log payload; render saved mood in log details; enable the skipped test.</td></tr>
<tr><td>S4</td><td>User support ticket history</td><td>Users can submit support and admins can respond, but users do not have a ticket-history page.</td><td>Add support history UI; fetch/render signed-in user&#39;s requests; show status/message/admin response; enable the skipped test.</td></tr>
<tr><td>S5</td><td>Separate clinic detail route</td><td>Clinic details are shown inline in the finder/cards, not on a separate route.</td><td>Add a dedicated route or modal with stable selectors for details/map/directions, or replace the skipped test with one matching the final inline design.</td></tr>
</table>
